{
  "category": "Shadow Pokémon",
  "entries": [
    {
      "text": "Under a full moon, this POKéMON likes to mimic the shadows of people and laugh at their fright.",
      "version": "red"
    },
    {
      "text": "Under a full moon, this POKéMON likes to mimic the shadows of people and laugh at their fright.",
      "version": "blue"
    },
    {
      "text": "A GENGAR is close by if you feel a sudden chill. It may be trying to lay a curse on you.",
      "version": "yellow"
    },
    {
      "text": "It steals heat from its surroundings. If you feel a sudden chill, it is certain that a GENGAR appeared.",
      "version": "gold"
    },
    {
      "text": "To steal the life of its target, it slips into the prey's shadow and silently waits for an opportunity.",
      "version": "silver"
    },
    {
      "text": "Hiding in people's shadows at night, it absorbs their heat. The chill it causes makes the victims shake.",
      "version": "crystal"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sometimes, on a dark night, your shadow thrown by a streetlight will suddenly and startlingly overtake you. It is actually a GENGAR running past you, pretending to be your shadow.",
      "version": "ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sometimes, on a dark night, your shadow thrown by a streetlight will suddenly and startlingly overtake you. It is actually a GENGAR running past you, pretending to be your shadow.",
      "version": "sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "Deep in the night, your shadow cast by a streetlight may suddenly overtake you. It is actually a GENGAR running past you, pretending to be your shadow.",
      "version": "emerald"
    },
    {
      "text": "It is said to emerge from darkness to steal the lives of those who become lost in mountains.",
      "version": "firered"
    },
    {
      "text": "On the night of a full moon, if shadows move on their own and laugh, it must be GENGAR’s doing.",
      "version": "leafgreen"
    },
    {
      "text": "It hides in shadows. It is said that if GENGAR is hiding, it cools the area by nearly 10 degrees F.",
      "version": "diamond"
    },
    {
      "text": "Lurking in the shadowy corners of rooms, it awaits chances to steal its prey’s life force.",
      "version": "pearl"
    },
    {
      "text": "The leer that floats in darkness belongs to a GENGAR delighting in casting curses on people.",
      "version": "platinum"
    },
    {
      "text": "It steals heat from its surroundings. If you feel a sudden chill, it is certain that a GENGAR appeared.",
      "version": "heartgold"
    },
    {
      "text": "To steal the life of its target, it slips into the prey’s shadow and silently waits for an opportunity.",
      "version": "soulsilver"
    },
    {
      "text": "The leer that floats in darkness belongs to a Gengar delighting in casting curses on people.",
      "version": "black"
    },
    {
      "text": "The leer that floats in darkness belongs to a Gengar delighting in casting curses on people.",
      "version": "white"
    },
    {
      "text": "The leer that floats in darkness belongs to a Gengar delighting in casting curses on people.",
      "version": "black-2"
    },
    {
      "text": "The leer that floats in darkness belongs to a Gengar delighting in casting curses on people.",
      "version": "white-2"
    },
    {
      "text": "It hides in shadows. It is said that if Gengar is hiding, it cools the area by nearly 10 degrees Fahrenheit.",
      "version": "x"
    },
    {
      "text": "Hiding in people’s shadows at night, it absorbs their heat. The chill it causes makes the victims shake.",
      "version": "y"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sometimes, on a dark night, your shadow thrown by a streetlight will suddenly and startlingly overtake you. It is actually a Gengar running past you, pretending to be your shadow.",
      "version": "omega-ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sometimes, on a dark night, your shadow thrown by a streetlight will suddenly and startlingly overtake you. It is actually a Gengar running past you, pretending to be your shadow.",
      "version": "alpha-sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "Should you feel yourself attacked by a sudden chill, it is evidence of an approaching Gengar. There is no escaping it. Give up.",
      "version": "sun"
    },
    {
      "text": "It apparently wishes for a traveling companion. Since it was once human itself, it tries to create one by taking the lives of other humans.",
      "version": "moon"
    },
    {
      "text": "You can hear tales told all over the world about how Gengar will pay a visit to children who are naughty.",
      "version": "ultra-sun"
    },
    {
      "text": "Even your home isn’t safe. Gengar will lurk in whatever dark corner of a room it can find and wait for its chance to catch its prey.",
      "version": "ultra-moon"
    },
    {
      "text": "A Gengar is close by if you feel a sudden chill. It may be trying to lay a curse on you.",
      "version": "lets-go-pikachu"
    },
    {
      "text": "A Gengar is close by if you feel a sudden chill. It may be trying to lay a curse on you.",
      "version": "lets-go-eevee"
    },
    {
      "text": "On the night of a full moon, if shadows move on their own and laugh, it must be Gengar’s doing.",
      "version": "sword"
    },
    {
      "text": "It is said to emerge from darkness to steal the lives of those who become lost in mountains.",
      "version": "shield"
    },
    {
      "text": "Possesses potential victims' shadows in an effort to steal away the victims' lives. If your shadow begins to laugh, you must take hold of a protective charm posthaste!",
      "version": "legends-arceus"
    }
  ],
